# Rebuild after changes

After editing plugin source (`source/`), `CMakeLists.txt`, or tests that affect the plugin target:

1. If `CMakeLists.txt` changed: `cmake -B Builds -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug`
2. Always run: `cmake --build Builds`
3. Prefer building install targets so DAWs get fresh copies: `MidiPhrases_VST3`, `MidiPhrases_AU`, and `MidiPhrases_Standalone` (full `cmake --build Builds` is fine).
4. Report build success or errors; do not ask the user to rebuild manually unless the build environment is broken.

Plugins install to `~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/` (VST3, AU) via `COPY_PLUGIN_AFTER_BUILD`. Remind the user to rescan in the DAW only when plugin binaries change, not for every edit.
